    {
      "id": "claim_75e4ec89206c41eab14f7eec9a442a68",
      "statement": "All cross-session state (the limit_sync high-water marks, the burn TSV sample cache, the float readout file, and the update-check cache) is best-effort and never breaks the render: a missing, unreadable, or corrupt cache degrades to defaults, and no filesystem error surfaces into the status line.",
