    {
      "id": "claim_3f88380a4a0e4061b3c7bfe1c0305be3",
      "statement": "The burn segment reads only samples with t >= now - lookback, where lookback is thresholds.burn_lookback (default 600s); a missing or unreadable file yields an empty sample set (warming state) rather than an error, and a sample is only appended when the 5-hour resets_at is at most 6h in the future.",
