      "id": "claim_62f8af719a8c4521ad0c1e4b4b0b159d",
      "statement": "The burn segment projects range-to-empty by linear regression over the lookback samples: warming (no samples), idle (slope <= 0), or active (slope > 0) with a colored ETA that is red if the window would run dry before reset, yellow within a 20% margin, and green otherwise; there is no 7-day TSV — the 7-day window is rendered statelessly.",
