    {
      "id": "claim_7df6d2edc25d4ccabbfb55743f094bc5",
      "statement": "The float is a plain-text side output of the status render: when thresholds.float is enabled, render_line calls float::emit_float, which renders the segments named in thresholds.float_segments (default \"model context cost\") as ANSI-free, icon-free text joined by float_sep (default \"  ·  \") and writes it to float_file (default ~/.claude/claudebar-float.txt); it is the seam for piping the status to tmux or a status bar.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/model/config.rs#L113-L120",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:41ad64cc1db818bcc696119746d2b2e7bd1b23658cce5177b944bda7f3b960aa:"
