      "id": "claim_e7f70bc2639543d18a10c9106c3a2c26",
      "statement": "The float readout reuses the exact same Segment implementations as the colored path (no second code path), rendered with the ASCII style and then stripped of ANSI color, so output is stable regardless of theme/style; a leading ~ in float_file expands to $HOME (a ~ without a resolvable $HOME is a no-op), unknown float_segments names are dropped, and the float never carries the update badge.",
