    {
      "id": "claim_25592257918644d1a54662c31abaf298",
      "statement": "The update-notice badge and background version check share one cache, update-check.json placed beside the config file (Config::default_path()), with schema {\"checked_at\": epoch, \"latest\": calver-or-null}, where latest is null on a failed check so the retry interval still applies.",
