    {
      "id": "claim_b2f7248046d84d7fb4ad292dbb209331",
      "statement": "The render hot path never touches the network: render_line calls refresh_in_background, which only when the cache is missing or older than REFRESH_INTERVAL (24h) claims the slot atomically with the still-known version and spawns a detached 'claudebar update --check' subprocess the caller never waits on; without a usable/writable cache path nothing is spawned.",
