    {
      "id": "claim_4c0dd1f74970489e8c4a6bcd3a4576e8",
      "statement": "The update cache is written with the float module's write_atomic (temp file + rename), so a torn read degrades to \"no cache\" and merely schedules a redundant check; reading a missing, unreadable, or malformed cache yields None.",
